m-blind at `document members`, as predicted — still fail-closed, now arm-pinned. Full `go test ./...` green, package coverage 88.6% -> 88.9%.\\nEOF\\necho appended; git diff --stat LOGBOOK.md\",\n  \"description\": \"Append logbook entry for rework\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"appended\\n LOGBOOK.md | 26 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++\\n 1 file changed, 26 insertions(+)\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 87,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 22,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
